      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LAST STYLEBENDER (1) will be bringing some solid recent Belmont efforts into this, and that form generally holds up strongly on this track. He benefits from a 4kg claim and is quick enough to make full use of the pole position. He will take some pegging back in this. RISE TO GLORY (2) resumes from a spell, and he has won fresh up in the past. He is nicely placed after a 2kg claim and should be ready to run a big race. Follow the market moves. SOMETHING ROYAL (5) found 1100m a touch beyond her on this track 10 days ago and drops back to her pet trip of 1000m. She has been up a while but can still figure in the top 3 in a race like this. MANTUA (7) did not run on as expected last start in a similar field off an unsuitable tempo, and he is expected to finish closer here with a drop back to 1000m. Stick with him. DIEGO DYNAMITE (6) finished third at Bunbury last start from a wide gate, and he carries only 50kg in this after a 4kg claim. Watch for him to be hitting the line late.",
